          "Simmer until vegetables are soft and stew is thick",
          "Serve fungi alongside pepperpot"
        ],
        "description": "Cornmeal and okra with a green vegetable stew — the other Antiguan national dish. Fungi is stirred constantly for smooth texture.",
        "image": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6e/Manoomin_%28wild_rice%29.jpg",
        "imageCredit": {
